Collaboration Emblem Attribution & Usage Notice

The bundled graphic asset `src/faser_mpl_style/assets/faser_logo.png` reproduces
the official FASER Collaboration emblem (CERN) derived from published FASER
Collaboration papers. This emblem is not covered by the MIT grant above for
endorsement or trademark purposes. Official FASER branding—including the
graphical FASER logo and experiment stamps such as "FASER", "FASER Preliminary",
and "FASERν"—must only be displayed on plots authorized by the FASER
Collaboration. Unofficial or independent studies using the stylesheets and
plotting utilities in this package should omit official FASER branding.
